1
00:00:11,937 --> 00:00:14,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:18,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没听错</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:21,373 --> 00:00:25,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是厌倦了做像扒窃这样可悲的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:28,637 --> 00:00:31,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还是那么混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:31,851 --> 00:00:37,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候教教你谁是老大了</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:41,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>出了一身汗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:41,246 --> 00:00:44,124
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在要回家好好泡个澡了</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:45,421 --> 00:00:48,132
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道剑心烧好热水没</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:48,218 --> 00:00:51,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>他早早回家了 所以应该…</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:52,643 --> 00:00:53,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:57,194 --> 00:00:58,321
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:01:14,812 --> 00:01:18,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:38,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>（关东集英组）</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:40,609 --> 00:02:42,069
<c.simplifiedchinese>固执的小屁孩</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:45,783
<c.simplifiedchinese>一句道歉就一笔勾销了</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:45,869 --> 00:02:47,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>慢点 我介</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:47,790 --> 00:02:52,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是极道中的刽子手
继续的话 他就真的没命了</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:52,925 --> 00:02:54,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>如你所愿</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:54,387 --> 00:02:56,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:56,516 --> 00:02:59,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>不扒窃的话 你要怎么活呀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:03:00,607 --> 00:03:03,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你觉得自己是武士后裔
就会安然无恙</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:03,153 --> 00:03:05,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你可就大错特错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:06,578 --> 00:03:10,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在是明治时代了
一切都要向钱看齐</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:11,044 --> 00:03:14,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟 荣耀可换不来金钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:15,887 --> 00:03:20,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士执着于自己的骄傲往事时</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:20,731 --> 00:03:23,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会让自己陷得更深</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:25,532 --> 00:03:31,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>妓院里挤满了骄傲武士的妻子和女儿</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:33,172 --> 00:03:37,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>每当他们抓到小偷
就都称自己为武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:37,389 --> 00:03:38,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>多可怜呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:43,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>忘掉这个“高贵血脉”吧 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:44,319 --> 00:03:47,280
<c.simplifiedchinese>学会谦卑地生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:47,868 --> 00:03:50,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就收留你做多西的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:51,041 --> 00:03:52,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>是件骄傲的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:54,214 --> 00:03:55,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>（仁义）</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:55,926 --> 00:03:58,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要让我再说一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:58,138 --> 00:03:59,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>我受够你们了</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:00,602 --> 00:04:01,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>你个混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:01,896 --> 00:04:04,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢对老大这个样子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:04,527 --> 00:04:09,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>你父母双亡时
是他收留你 救了你一命！</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:09,578 --> 00:04:10,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>你个臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:12,459 --> 00:04:17,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>你父亲是穷人 只有两英亩地和仆人</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:17,928 --> 00:04:21,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后像傻子一样
捍卫帝国军队战死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:23,063 --> 00:04:28,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>你母亲只能去妓院卖身 直到病死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:28,533 --> 00:04:32,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道你会走谁的路
但你是你愚蠢父母的孩子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:37,425 --> 00:04:38,718
<c.simplifiedchinese>我介先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:40,306 --> 00:04:41,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的父亲</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:41,684 --> 00:04:46,522
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然他羞于背叛幕府 投靠帝国军队</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:46,611 --> 00:04:49,197
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是他加入彰义队 为正义牺牲生命</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:50,076 --> 00:04:53,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>我母亲为了抚养我
把自己的一生都荒废了</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:53,917 --> 00:04:56,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到被疾病摧残至死</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:57,215 --> 00:05:01,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的父母曾享荣誉 曾高贵地活着！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:01,139 --> 00:05:04,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>我决不原谅任何羞辱他们的人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:06,316 --> 00:05:08,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才是那个不会原谅你的人 混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:11,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:18,132 --> 00:05:20,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…你到底是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:20,094 --> 00:05:23,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>袭…袭击！快拿下他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:24,561 --> 00:05:26,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们不会来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:26,565 --> 00:05:31,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们不让在下进来
在下就请他们小睡了一会儿</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:31,951 --> 00:05:32,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>什…</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:33,537 --> 00:05:35,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:36,293 --> 00:05:39,379
<c.simplifiedchinese>此行前来是为了
让你们把孩子交给在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:39,465 --> 00:05:41,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:41,428 --> 00:05:42,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>我介先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:42,471 --> 00:05:43,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也是武士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:43,933 --> 00:05:45,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要立刻杀了你们两个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:47,983 --> 00:05:50,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>话还没说完呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:50,195 --> 00:05:52,156
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那安静地待一会儿</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:52,241 --> 00:05:53,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>我介先生…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:54,495 --> 00:05:56,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>你意下如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:56,667 --> 00:06:02,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>你能大发慈悲把他交给在下吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:05,476 --> 00:06:11,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可能比你的帮派
被彻底毁灭更让你没颜面…</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:13,659 --> 00:06:14,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:14,828 --> 00:06:16,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…我明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:16,373 --> 00:06:18,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>你自己带走他吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:19,045 --> 00:06:20,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:20,547 --> 00:06:21,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 提出无理的要求</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:22,761 --> 00:06:25,138
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还好吗 孩子？</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:26,267 --> 00:06:28,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为在下不知道这个地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:28,146 --> 00:06:31,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪费了点时间
把周围的极道都找了一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:32,446 --> 00:06:35,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁叫你来救我的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:35,787 --> 00:06:37,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明明可以一个人打败他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:37,791 --> 00:06:38,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明明可以打败他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:41,423 --> 00:06:42,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:43,343 --> 00:06:46,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来在下又低估你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果是这样的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:50,232 --> 00:06:53,193
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少让在下为这些伤道一下歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:55,492 --> 00:06:59,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>-别想走！
-等一下 没关系！</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:00,294 --> 00:07:02,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>那只是刽子手的眼线</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:03,091 --> 00:07:05,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是极道的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:05,679 --> 00:07:07,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:09,562 --> 00:07:14,525
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道明治时代还有这么一号人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:14,614 --> 00:07:19,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论有多少人 都不足以对付他</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:19,624 --> 00:07:23,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>他只要一个小孩的话 还不算很亏…</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:25,804 --> 00:07:27,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:28,225 --> 00:07:29,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:30,229 --> 00:07:31,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:32,316 --> 00:07:33,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:34,362 --> 00:07:35,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:36,282 --> 00:07:39,327
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那么为自己的弱小而不甘心吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:39,414 --> 00:07:40,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>孩子？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:40,541 --> 00:07:41,750
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:43,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:44,715 --> 00:07:47,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>强到不需要任何人的帮助…</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:48,265 --> 00:07:53,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>强到可以自己维护父母的尊严…</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:56,573 --> 00:07:57,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想变…</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:58,618 --> 00:07:59,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:04,672 --> 00:08:06,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>他去了好久…</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:06,468 --> 00:08:10,180
<c.simplifiedchinese>我相信剑心一定没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:10,267 --> 00:08:11,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那孩子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:14,525 --> 00:08:15,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:16,863 --> 00:08:17,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:18,617 --> 00:08:20,785
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:20,871 --> 00:08:23,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>外面有辆马车等着带他去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:23,835 --> 00:08:27,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷薰女士 神谷活心流的代理师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:30,474 --> 00:08:32,851
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天起 她就是你的师父了</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:33,813 --> 00:08:34,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:35,025 --> 00:08:37,361
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在叫我学剑术吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:37,446 --> 00:08:38,697
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还是跟这个丑女学？</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:38,782 --> 00:08:41,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父？这孩子是我的徒弟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:41,162 --> 00:08:42,163
<c.simplifiedchinese>对</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:45,045 --> 00:08:47,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>取决于你的努力程度</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:48,385 --> 00:08:52,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要多强有多强</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:52,851 --> 00:08:54,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:58,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 你刚刚又叫我丑女了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:59,323 --> 00:09:00,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么问题吗 丑女？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:00,742 --> 00:09:03,745
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我叫你别那么叫了！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:03,832 --> 00:09:05,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>-丑女…
-你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:09,632
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎样 你先握着试试</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:09,719 --> 00:09:10,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>来</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:12,975 --> 00:09:13,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:17,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不需要你指导 丑女！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:17,401 --> 00:09:20,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫你别那么叫我了！
我要把你打晕！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:20,616 --> 00:09:22,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？试试呀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:23,079 --> 00:09:24,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:26,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>两位都非常勇敢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:26,794 --> 00:09:28,963
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你也和他说说！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:29,050 --> 00:09:30,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>这孩子的嘴太臭了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:30,427 --> 00:09:31,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,765
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是你的新徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:33,850 --> 00:09:35,101
<c.simplifiedchinese>对他温柔一点…</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:35,187 --> 00:09:37,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>温柔个鬼啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:37,775 --> 00:09:39,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷活心流）</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:39,654 --> 00:09:42,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>一、二、三…</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:42,576 --> 00:09:45,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>哇 有15多个人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:45,415 --> 00:09:48,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>打倒剑客警官的流言传开了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:50,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流要振兴了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:51,886 --> 00:09:53,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不好…
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:54,015 --> 00:09:56,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:56,312 --> 00:10:00,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不用神谷活心流 也不想带徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:00,946 --> 00:10:03,115
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你们是因为昨天的事来的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:03,827 --> 00:10:06,788
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 你们得回去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:10,674 --> 00:10:12,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在没问题了</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:12,469 --> 00:10:13,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>什…</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:16,686 --> 00:10:19,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没叫他们走的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:19,817 --> 00:10:22,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能有好多徒弟呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:22,322 --> 00:10:27,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>怀着一点点兴趣的人
只能坚持半年左右</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:28,041 --> 00:10:29,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就事与愿违了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:30,756 --> 00:10:35,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>相反 你应该花时间
教真正有动力的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:37,018 --> 00:10:40,396
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 我也是来变强的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:40,484 --> 00:10:42,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果是受这种小丫头指导？</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:42,654 --> 00:10:44,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真是浪费时间
-小…</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:47,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你叫我变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:47,372 --> 00:10:49,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么不教我你的流派？</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:50,170 --> 00:10:53,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不想传授飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:54,428 --> 00:10:56,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下只是个旁观者</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:56,974 --> 00:10:59,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是属于神谷活心流的</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:59,313 --> 00:11:01,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了活人剑 你就会变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:01,901 --> 00:11:03,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>-别闹了！
-就要闹！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:04,072 --> 00:11:05,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>-但你都没在听…
-好吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:05,575 --> 00:11:06,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>我等着瞧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:11,169 --> 00:11:12,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:12,214 --> 00:11:13,048
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:16,347 --> 00:11:17,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:18,058 --> 00:11:19,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:19,395 --> 00:11:20,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:21,524 --> 00:11:25,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的
一会儿没盯着他 他就跑去偷懒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:25,949 --> 00:11:28,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话粗鲁、性格固执、毫无胆量</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:29,038 --> 00:11:32,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心看上他什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:33,298 --> 00:11:35,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来你就是这么想我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:35,927 --> 00:11:38,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可没有答应要学这种流派！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:39,351 --> 00:11:42,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>我自己学总比跟你学好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:43,651 --> 00:11:46,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说啊 那天那些人来了又走
不是你的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:46,866 --> 00:11:51,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>但即使已经澄清拔刀斋的虚假指控了
你的徒弟还是一个都没有回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:53,379 --> 00:11:54,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:54,632 --> 00:11:59,428
<c.simplifiedchinese>可能大家厌倦代理师父了</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:06,989 --> 00:12:08,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰…薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:08,993 --> 00:12:11,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>请…请帮帮我们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:11,582 --> 00:12:12,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>平！</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:13,043 --> 00:12:14,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有佐藤！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:14,672 --> 00:12:15,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们的伤是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:16,007 --> 00:12:17,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>发生什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:19,598 --> 00:12:21,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们现在逃不掉了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:21,309 --> 00:12:22,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们要杀了你们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:24,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:24,983 --> 00:12:26,985
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们对我以前的徒弟做什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:27,071 --> 00:12:29,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 别多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:31,622 --> 00:12:32,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>看我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:42,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:42,436 --> 00:12:43,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我解释一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:45,650 --> 00:12:50,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…他们喝醉了 在小镇上惹祸…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:50,618 --> 00:12:51,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:51,537 --> 00:12:55,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们在找麻烦
我们想让他们安静下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:58,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后他们的同伙来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:12:58,091 --> 00:13:00,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>开始追我们 想报复我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:01,932 --> 00:13:04,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>-他们去哪了？
-这边！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:07,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:07,944 --> 00:13:09,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>好…好多人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:09,990 --> 00:13:11,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们人手太多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:11,786 --> 00:13:13,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家快进道场！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:16,837 --> 00:13:17,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:17,881 --> 00:13:18,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜂须贺先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:19,885 --> 00:13:22,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>多好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:23,391 --> 00:13:28,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>让他们看看
反抗菱万愚连队有什么后果！</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:29,905 --> 00:13:31,156
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想起来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:31,241 --> 00:13:33,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是菱万愚连队的</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:34,455 --> 00:13:36,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>菱万愚连队？</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:36,417 --> 00:13:38,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像民间犯罪组织</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:39,465 --> 00:13:42,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们比极道还危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:43,641 --> 00:13:48,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下不妙了 为什么这事
偏偏发生在剑心刚走的时候？</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:48,149 --> 00:13:49,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:49,151 --> 00:13:52,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才没见过他 他去哪儿了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:52,116 --> 00:13:56,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫他去买东西了
米、盐、味增、酱油…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:57,293 --> 00:13:58,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:58,503 --> 00:14:01,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>你非得一次性买完吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:01,134 --> 00:14:03,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…我们该怎么办 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:03,221 --> 00:14:05,265
<c.simplifiedchinese>“我们”是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:05,350 --> 00:14:07,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你们这些蠢货惹的麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:07,313 --> 00:14:09,148
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是他们的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:09,902 --> 00:14:11,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你才是真的蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:12,239 --> 00:14:14,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你真的信他们说的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:17,333 --> 00:14:20,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>我注意到你们刚刚跑的时候
嘴里有清酒的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:20,632 --> 00:14:24,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>惹麻烦的不是菱万愚连队 而是你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:29,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你们和他们打了一架</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:35,703 --> 00:14:37,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的是这样吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:40,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:46,474 --> 00:14:48,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们可不敢反抗菱万愚连队！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:49,063 --> 00:14:50,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>快出来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:50,817 --> 00:14:52,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不然
我们就毁了你们这没用的道场！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:54,073 --> 00:14:57,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>-木炮？
-他们哪找的这玩意儿？</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:57,914 --> 00:14:59,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>木炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:14:59,417 --> 00:15:02,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>橡木做的简易大炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:02,506 --> 00:15:06,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时用粘土做的炮弹来射击</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:06,556 --> 00:15:10,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>威力比得上普通大炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:10,355 --> 00:15:14,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是菱万愚连队的威力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:14,906 --> 00:15:18,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们以为你们的剑术很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:18,455 --> 00:15:22,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们会为
打断我们兄弟的胳膊付出代价的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:23,966 --> 00:15:27,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们喝醉了 还用剑打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:27,473 --> 00:15:28,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤了人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:30,103 --> 00:15:32,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>菱万愚连队或许愚蠢粗暴</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:35,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你们更差劲</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:35,865 --> 00:15:41,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们这些以前的徒弟
遇到困难就夹着尾巴逃走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:46,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在遇到麻烦了才想到要回来啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:50,644 --> 00:15:53,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们躲不了了 快出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:53,650 --> 00:15:55,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>自己来带他们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:55,780 --> 00:15:57,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:57,867 --> 00:15:59,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么这样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:03,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！我们可是冲你和那女孩来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:06,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁让你们帮那两混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:06,092 --> 00:16:07,760
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:07,846 --> 00:16:10,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>想报仇的话就冲着我来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:11,937 --> 00:16:14,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>放过他们三个</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:14,901 --> 00:16:17,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 你在做什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:17,573 --> 00:16:21,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们的剑术是我父亲和我教的</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:21,664 --> 00:16:27,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然他们离开了
但干的蠢事还是我的责任</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:27,342 --> 00:16:30,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>我努力…</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:30,140 --> 00:16:33,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>教授活人剑来惠及他人</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:34,565 --> 00:16:37,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来那只是空谈</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:38,908 --> 00:16:43,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 只要你有心想变强
在其他地方也可以成长</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:44,502 --> 00:16:45,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>要努力训练哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:48,676 --> 00:16:52,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要一人承担责任？</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:53,561 --> 00:16:58,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>女武士也不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:01,702 --> 00:17:03,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>别逗我笑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:04,333 --> 00:17:08,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>明神弥彦一点也不像那些败类！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:08,591 --> 00:17:12,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不会坐以待毙 看你受伤！</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:12,724 --> 00:17:13,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜂须贺先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:13,936 --> 00:17:15,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:15,772 --> 00:17:18,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不会放了你 我要杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:21,990
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杀了你”听着可不好呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:23,329 --> 00:17:24,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:25,250 --> 00:17:26,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们或许做错了事</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:27,629 --> 00:17:30,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不至于用大炮吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:30,176 --> 00:17:34,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束这场闹剧吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:34,643 --> 00:17:36,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>吵死了 你是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:36,814 --> 00:17:39,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>-蜂须贺先生 这人不好惹
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:40,071 --> 00:17:45,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>还记得那个靠一己之力
打倒剑客警官的浪客吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:45,582 --> 00:17:46,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想就是他</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:47,002 --> 00:17:48,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>胆小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:48,379 --> 00:17:50,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>区区浪客有什么好怕的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:50,968 --> 00:17:53,346
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们可是有这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:53,431 --> 00:17:55,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备发射木炮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:55,143 --> 00:17:56,394
<c.simplifiedchinese>是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:57,230 --> 00:17:58,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>-剑心！
-开炮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:10,507 --> 00:18:12,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>这把逆刃刀的另一边</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:13,012 --> 00:18:16,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了砍人
可以毫不犹豫地砍倒任何物体</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:16,978 --> 00:18:18,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>重申一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:20,151 --> 00:18:21,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束这场闹剧</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:24,326 --> 00:18:25,703
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:26,372 --> 00:18:27,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:28,209 --> 00:18:29,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>兄弟们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:29,294 --> 00:18:30,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>是…是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:30,922 --> 00:18:31,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>打道回府！</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:34,555 --> 00:18:35,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:36,016 --> 00:18:39,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下离开时发生了这么多事</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:39,189 --> 00:18:40,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:40,483 --> 00:18:42,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事了 回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:43,656 --> 00:18:47,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>但从现在起 忘了自己是这里的徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:47,789 --> 00:18:49,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要再持剑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:52,382 --> 00:18:53,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>平</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:56,682 --> 00:18:57,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>肩膀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:58,811 --> 00:19:00,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>记得给医生好好看看</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>（徒弟）</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:16,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>打起精神来 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:18,643 --> 00:19:22,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算竭力教导徒弟正义之道</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:22,734 --> 00:19:25,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有时候就是会教不到他们心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:25,573 --> 00:19:27,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷薰）</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:27,410 --> 00:19:29,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要哭了</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:29,456 --> 00:19:30,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>都不像你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:37,472 --> 00:19:40,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不会像他们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,147
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要加入你的道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:44,236 --> 00:19:47,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不能一下子像剑心那么厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:47,450 --> 00:19:50,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先 我得耐心点和你好好相处</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:53,421 --> 00:19:55,965
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！我们收拾收拾 开始练习！</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:57,679 --> 00:19:58,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:59,558 --> 00:20:02,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>有些人你确实能教到心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:11,373 --> 00:20:13,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没时间胡闹了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:20:13,753 --> 00:20:15,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>快点 薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:20:15,172 --> 00:20:16,965
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要快点变强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:17,051 --> 00:20:18,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以现在不侮辱我了 改直呼名了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:19,932 --> 00:20:21,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:21,685 --> 00:20:22,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父 无</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:23,606 --> 00:20:25,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>代理师父 神谷薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:25,985 --> 00:20:28,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>徒弟 明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:32,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一名浪客 绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:32,791 --> 00:20:35,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治11年 早春</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:35,588 --> 00:20:40,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们迈出了第一小步</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:22:16,498 --> 00:22:19,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白 你赢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:22:19,295 --> 00:22:22,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>你更厉害 请原谅我们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:22:22,092 --> 00:22:24,428
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们只是心情不好</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:22:24,514 --> 00:22:26,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用叫我停下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:22:28,731 --> 00:22:31,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们太弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:22:31,319 --> 00:22:34,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>再过分点就是霸凌了</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:22:34,868 --> 00:22:38,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的 打得好无聊</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:22:40,170 --> 00:22:43,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里没有真正能打的人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:22:47,351 --> 00:22:51,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回
《从事打手的男人 相乐左之助》</c.simplifiedchinese>

